rsclip-indra-ocr

This crate adapts preprocessing and decoding algorithms from Indra OCR:
https://github.com/datalab-to/indra
Copyright Datalab and the Indra contributors. Licensed under Apache-2.0.
Reference source commit: 3d773aeedc5d79d1d0a2a04007a9075cd71a59f4.

Changes: rewritten in Rust using image and ort; image-only plain-text pipeline,
single-line recognition batches, pairwise reading order, bounded image input,
and suppression of overlapping duplicate glyph fragments.
It does not implement Indra's PDF, deskew, layout, table or math pipeline.

Indra model weights are separately licensed under Datalab's modified OpenRAIL-M
license. They are not included in this crate. The download script preserves
their LICENSE beside the weights.
